# Browser
# Incinerator of the Guilty at a table, Bot1 a browser page: its combat damage trigger's X is collect evidence X (CR 701.59a,
# 107.3f) - the total mana value of the cards exiled from Bot1's graveyard - not mana, and the dock says so: "collect evidence 1"
# once Bot1 raises X to 1 with the stepper, never "{0}". Turn 1: Black Lotus, Mox Ruby, Mox Pearl and a Mountain cast it.
# Turn 3: Bot1 bolts Bot2, so its graveyard holds Black Lotus (0) and Lightning Bolt (1), attacks, and collects evidence 1,
# exiling the Bolt. Bot2 took 3 and 6, and has no creature or planeswalker for the reflexive ability to damage.
